{"id":"vod_sn_38849","vodId":"38849","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"锖色护甲","name_cn":"锖色护甲","date":"2022-01-01","year":"2022","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"更新至第12集","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/1e15615eb9e5809c7938e0841bd02a27.jpg"},"summary":"战国时代著名人物之间的战争风云。由于漫长的战乱，室町幕府日渐式微世界进入了崇尚血债血偿的战国时代山海秘境，纪之国这片茂密的森林深处，有一个以八咫乌为军旗纹章的枪炮集团。他们以佣兵为业，驰骋沙场，其名为“杂贺众”。继承杂贺众首领名号的人名为孙一，是一名从异国漂流至此的青年。而另一边，最早察觉欧洲列强侵略意图的三郎，则为了守护日本而四处奔走。原本毫无交集的两人随着异国侵略者的袭击而产生了联系。这群身处战国时代的男人会如何贯彻自己的信念与正义。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:05:10","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/HeMzbeK9pc1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/e9aE5K4LVB1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/mtgrMPce4G1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/tgNhxJKM7p1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/K7y7YWe38W1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ERGMdZr5rz1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/8c3kXMRAzr1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/rVbtqVmYqw1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ggvXjWGzkf1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/5Ty868BJV41/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/azajRaAgVe1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/CbM89xY1QF1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:44:53.902Z"}